  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Lord plagued Pharaoh and his house with great plagues, Gen. 12:17. waters … shall be turned to blood, Ex. 7:17. will smite all thy borders with frogs, Ex. 8:2. dust … may become lice, Ex. 8:16. I will send swarms of flies, Ex. 8:21. thy cattle … there shall be a very grievous murrain, Ex. 9:3. boil breaking forth with blains, Ex. 9:9. cause it to rain a very grievous hail, Ex. 9:18. I bring the locusts, Ex. 10:4. thick darkness in … Egypt, Ex. 10:22. firstborn in … Egypt shall die, Ex. 11:5. Lord smote all the firstborn, Ex. 12:29. plagued the people, because they made the calf, Ex. 32:35. seven times more plagues upon you, Lev. 26:21. smote the people with a very great plague, Num. 11:33. those men … died by the plague, Num. 14:37. wrath gone out from the Lord; the plague is begun, Num. 16:46. not hearken … all these curses shall come, Deut. 28:15. Lord will make thy plagues wonderful, Deut. 28:59. I sent Moses … and I plagued Egypt, Josh. 24:5. with a great plague will the Lord smite thy people, 2 Chr. 21:14. hiss because of all the plagues, Jer. 19:8. death, I will be thy plagues, Hosea 13:14. will smite all the people that have fought against Jerusalem, Zech. 14:12.",
